From: nhansp <nhan.094.vn@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] nvidia: galen: p2888-0001-p2822-0000: poll SD card

The card-detect GPIO of the AGX Xavier devkit SD slot on this unit does
not report insertion, so the SD card (Docker data root) is never
probed. Poll for the card instead and enable sdhci@3440000, matching
the device tree the board ran on stock L4T R35.4.1.

The deployed tegra194-p2888-0001-p2822-0000.dtb is built from this file
by nvidia/platform/t19x/galen/kernel-dts/Makefile, not from
arch/arm64/boot/dts/nvidia/.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [board-specific]
Signed-off-by: nhansp <nhan.094.vn@gmail.com>
---
diff --git a/nvidia/platform/t19x/galen/kernel-dts/tegra194-p2888-0001-p2822-0000.dts b/nvidia/platform/t19x/galen/kernel-dts/tegra194-p2888-0001-p2822-0000.dts
--- a/nvidia/platform/t19x/galen/kernel-dts/tegra194-p2888-0001-p2822-0000.dts
+++ b/nvidia/platform/t19x/galen/kernel-dts/tegra194-p2888-0001-p2822-0000.dts
@@ -52,3 +52,21 @@
 };
 
 #endif
+
+/ {
+	/*
+	 * The card-detect line of the SD slot on this unit does not report
+	 * insertion reliably; poll for the card instead. Matches the DTB the
+	 * board ran on stock L4T R35.4.1.
+	 */
+	sdhci@3400000 {
+		broken-cd;
+		/delete-property/ cd-gpios;
+		/delete-property/ cd-inverted;
+		/delete-property/ nvidia,cd-wakeup-capable;
+	};
+
+	sdhci@3440000 {
+		status = "okay";
+	};
+};
